    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "rest and heal feels like a joke. how do you heal from being nothing? it's not just a slump. it's like the engine is gone. there's no \"new path\" because the person who could even walk a path is dead. i'm just waiting for the rest of me to catch up and disappear too. it just feels so heavy, like the void is pulling at everything. i'm so tired of the performance.",
